Implements PRD §7.5 requirements:

DX-1: 16 structured error codes (SKILL_NOT_FOUND, SKILL_PARSE_ERROR, etc.)
DX-2: Every error includes actionable remediation guidance
DX-3: diagnose_skill() function for automated health checks

- errors.py: Error codes, SkillError class, remediation map, diagnostics
- __init__.py: Package exports
- test_skill_errors.py: Tests for all error codes and diagnostic scenarios

All error responses are JSON-serializable for API integration.
